(text "Isolation barrier (user rulings 2026-10-05 / 2026-10-07): the application processor (AP) is its own ground domain (GND_AP, VAP_IO). Everything that crosses to the FPGA/analog side goes through isolators: U501 MAX22445C = control SPI (SCLK/CS_N/MOSI AP->FPGA, MISO back), U502 MAX22445F = I2S with the FPGA as master (BCLK/LRCLK FPGA->AP + FPGA_IRQ_N, SDATA AP->FPGA; sides swapped), U503 MAX22444C = AP reset -> EXT_RST_N (+3 spare fwd), U504 ISO1640 = I2C to the four TMP117 (sensor bus on the FPGA/analog side, V33D = ISO1640 side 1; AP = side 2, VAP_IO >= 2.25 V). FPGA side of the MAX2244x = V18 (1.71 V capable; ISO77xx were not - 2026-10-09). AP board not yet selected. Conn1/J506 is the 240-contact SEAF-40 site: west edge, closest to FPGA, main-board bottom. VAP_IO/GND_AP serve the AP and AP-side isolator supplies; V33_IF_IN/GND feed the separate carrier-side 1.8 V LDO. Conn1 carries 30 V12SOM contacts with a GND surround; J507/J508 are removed. SOM_PG is included but still needs an isolation-path review. SPI: 10 MHz standard-timed guaranteed, 50 MHz with AP RX sample delay (bom 21)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "966b4936-610d-4893-85f6-9a55c267fe44"))
(text "Conn1 power allocation: 30 x V12SOM plus 30 GND perimeter contacts; 4 x V33_IF_IN plus 12 carrier-GND guard contacts. V33_IF_IN is distinct from VAP_IO/GND_AP. Local 1.8 V LDO MPN/output wiring remains to be added." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 31.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "38bb55a0-9378-4fac-82a0-5e7fa17bed24"))
(text "TMP117 placement (bom 20, 4 so far): U505 L cascode/replica array, U506 R cascode/replica array, U507 R_off/Rpad heat zone, U508 clock XO area. V33D = digital 3.3 V (power sheet, PWR_FLAG here). ALERT pins unused. Pull-ups 2.2k each side of the ISO1640." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 24.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "042f773f-1a46-44e6-81f2-3a3b248fd4ef"))
(symbol (lib_id "bfdac:Samtec_SEAF40") (at 39.370 59.690 0) (unit 1) (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "08f7eab3-929a-4962-8a1e-507f3d34730c") (property "Reference" "J506" (at 42.370 58.390 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Value" "AP DIG + PWR" (at 42.370 60.990 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Footprint" "bfdac:Samtec_SEAF-40-05.0-L-06-2-A_40x6_P1.27mm" (at 39.370 59.690 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Datasheet" "" (at 39.370 59.690 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Description" "Samtec SEAF-40 40x6, 240 passive contacts. Conn1/J506 row A preserves AP nets 1-40; rows B-F carry V12SOM/GND surround, V33_IF_IN/GND guard and AP-ground return field per docs/SEAF_PIN_ASSIGNMENTS.md. West edge closest to FPGA, B.Cu." (at 39.370 59.690 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "MPN" "SEAF-40-05.0-L-06-2-A-K-TR" (at 39.370 59.690 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (pin "1" (uuid "279970e2-f608-49f5-99af-e14336067810")) (pin "2" (uuid "06925caf-238b-4e7f-8d7a-f7931777a4c1")) (pin "3" (uuid "093af5f7-d822-4f23-9fbf-05f97a34ae51")) (pin "4" (uuid "f5021c5b-6345-4f49-92ad-b73ad8451d98")) (pin "5" (uuid "25c50a15-d568-492f-aa40-2149fdf92541")) (pin "6" (uuid "6029f7fa-ee85-47eb-86a8-7f8865ea7da2")) (pin "7" (uuid "5dd46841-f425-477c-9d1f-93689033b237")) (pin "8" (uuid "3515261a-bf23-4b91-b9de-38fedffea84f")) (pin "9" (uuid "fccc4535-4e24-4526-a1f7-000e5d4d9981")) (pin "10" (uuid "6d93f2be-8099-44a6-8a0b-44559f2e1dda")) (pin "11" (uuid "3e18dfb7-18bd-4894-96c7-d46f112f2e40")) (pin "12" (uuid "4b3976c3-5772-4880-824f-e31810e451a8")) (pin "13" (uuid "6afe3730-1b81-4c35-9b5a-c04e88c56576")) (pin "14" (uuid "25c4d978-2b63-4fe3-b4fa-5426545a1ea2")) (pin "15" (uuid "974a1e41-3590-4e37-bfc0-7c9c072dc418")) (pin "16" (uuid "9d79d803-c0e9-4569-ac34-b90906a6ba33")) (pin "17" (uuid "64d0311a-5ad5-471a-857f-02db937a