(text "RAIL TELEMETRY (bom 17(m2)/(m3)): U510 (UCD_L) watches the L-channel POL rails + V33CLK/V33FF/V33RLY + the four pre-regs; U511 (UCD_R) watches the R-channel rails + V33D/V18/V12SOM + the same four pre-regs (cross-check). 26 of 26 MON inputs used - every rail on the board. MON window 0-2.5 V: positive rails divided to GND (100k/10k for 12-16.5 V, 49.9k/10k for 7-9 V, 20k/20k for 3.3-4.3 V and V18); NEGATIVE rails (N15A/VEE15/N16A) via 100k to rail + 10k pull-UP to V33D -> Vmon = 1.50-1.64 V at the -15/-16.2 V setpoints, monotone to 0 V, with a BAT54 clamp so a live negative rail cannot drag MON below ~-0.35 V while V33D is down. Bus = SENS_SDA/SENS_SCL behind U504 ISO1640 with the TMP117s (400 kHz, 2.2 k pull-ups unchanged). Alerts = AP polling (SMBALERT# not routed; PMBALERT pulled up and left unread).  PMBUS_CNTRL -> GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 275.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a24c6869-ab14-4efe-9751-e0cb4bc8a30f"))
(text "ADDRESSES (resistor straps on PMBUS_ADDR0/1, analog pins per SLVSAN9C): UCD_L 10k/10k to GND, UCD_R 10k/20k - DISTINCT, and both strapped away from the 126/JTAG default.  ** VERIFY chosen values against the TI address-detection table and record the resulting PMBus addresses here **.  Straps: RESET = 10k pull-up + 1 nF; TRST 10k to GND; TDI/TMS/TRCK/PMBALERT 10k straps; BPCAP 100 nF. V33FB -> V33D (3.3 V feedback sense) ** VERIFY V33FB/CNTRL/TRCK strapping **. J505 = DNP bring-up header (3V3/SCL/SDA/GND)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 290.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d2ab833a-9c2c-4005-8473-7f1abc7ff903"))
(symbol (lib_id "bfdac:UCD90120A") (at 299.720 330.200 0) (unit 1) (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "0a02bc92-f87e-4340-b814-d30e9dcf85fa") (property "Reference" "U510" (at 302.720 328.900 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Value" "UCD90120A" (at 302.720 331.500 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Footprint" "Package_DFN_QFN:QFN-64-1EP_9x9mm_P0.5mm_EP3.8x3.8mm" (at 299.720 330.200 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Datasheet" "" (at 299.720 330.200 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Description" "13-input PMBus rail monitor, VQFN-64 RGC; TELEMETRY ONLY - not in the mute path (17(m2)/(m3)); AP pushes config over the sensor I2C bus at boot; 2 on the board (UCD_L / UCD_R). Pin map verified SLVSAN9C 2026-10-12 ** VERIFY: footprint EP, BPCAP value, V33FB/CNTRL/TRCK strapping **" (at 299.720 330.200 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "MPN" "UCD90120ARGCR" (at 299.720 330.200 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (pin "1" (uuid "57cd212b-617e-4732-97fa-449d42da426b")) (pin "2" (uuid "21cfae05-7fd6-4351-bf48-8f2cc0ada13d")) (pin "3" (uuid "73cf44ac-4e53-4f48-b98a-7d10f3187410")) (pin "4" (uuid "ac6cc54b-b47e-4f44-b341-de00a446f66c")) (pin "5" (uuid "4aef6d2a-60f5-4370-bf0a-062b380272c9")) (pin "6" (uuid "4a01e30d-8098-46db-8857-3fb808a27bb7")) (pin "59" (uuid "9c5780e2-c6f5-49fa-849a-f43580cc7468")) (pin "62" (uuid "f52ab4aa-699a-41bb-b0fe-9a2af8cfc007")) (pin "63" (uuid "243e3da8-6465-41dd-8e2d-484058defe1d")) (pin "50" (uuid "f8b1ed33-3cd8-47c8-bd02-b6592c84133f")) (pin "52" (uuid "e1327b7c-ad2a-4a53-80ce-e32795e4a72c")) (pin "54" (uuid "afa59c78-2181-4878-b614-4282dc7d710d")) (pin "56" (uuid "e088cf0b-5729-4dbb-924c-a4323eed5f2a")) (pin "9" (uuid "7de07fd6-0fe5-4bb5-9fb1-6eeac58cd771")) (pin "10" (uuid "d6abecd2-1009-4773-8b05-fc7a682f479a")) (pin "49" (uuid "97a391fd-980e-4c7c-8967-5cb540db5929")) (